{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "9d7a2b6e-9e3e-4b8c-8e60-4a1a6a7d9a10",
    "name": "Coco Bank - Order Portfolio Impact",
    "description": "Casos manuales que combinan el envío de órdenes con la consulta de portfolio para verificar cómo cada estado de orden afecta el saldo disponible, el total de cuenta y las tenencias. Ejecutar en secuencia (de arriba hacia abajo) contra la aplicación local encendida. Usa la cuenta de referencia userId=1/accountNumber=10001; como las órdenes aceptadas se persisten, cada corrida modifica el estado real de esa cuenta en la base local — no ejecutar contra una base compartida. Cada solicitud de orden usa una clave de idempotencia dinámica ({{$randomUUID}}) para que la colección se pueda volver a correr sin que una repetición devuelva un resultado cacheado y oculte el efecto real. No hay autenticación en la API.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "7024653"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "01 - Portfolio inicial (captura baseline)",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [{"key": "Accept", "value": "application/json"}],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/{{userId}}/portfolio?accountNumber={{accountNumber}}",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["api", "v1", "users", "{{userId}}", "portfolio"],
          "query": [{"key": "accountNumber", "value": "{{accountNumber}}"}]
        },
        "description": "Guarda el efectivo disponible, el total de cuenta y las cantidades de los instrumentos usados más abajo, para poder comparar con valores relativos (no absolutos) sin importar cuántas veces se corrió antes esta colección."
      },
      "event": [{
        "listen": "test",
        "script": {
          "type": "text/javascript",
          "exec": [
            "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
            "const body = pm.response.json();",
            "pm.collectionVariables.set('baselineAvailableCash', body.availableCash);",
            "pm.collectionVariables.set('baselineTotalValue', body.totalAccountValue);",
            "const marketInstrument = body.instruments.find((i) => i.instrumentId === Number(pm.collectionVariables.get('instrumentIdMarket')));",
            "pm.collectionVariables.set('baselineQtyMarket', marketInstrument ? marketInstrument.quantity : 0);",
            "console.log('baseline availableCash=' + body.availableCash + ' totalAccountValue=' + body.totalAccountValue);"
          ]
        }
      }]
    },
    {
      "name": "02 - LIMIT BUY pendiente (reserva, no ejecuta)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"},
          {"key": "Idempotency-Key", "value": "{{$randomUUID}}"}
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/{{userId}}/orders",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["api", "v1", "users", "{{userId}}", "orders"]
        },
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"instrumentId\": {{instrumentIdLimit}},\n  \"side\": \"BUY\",\n  \"type\": \"LIMIT\",\n  \"amount\": 100.00,\n  \"price\": 10.00\n}",
          "options": {"raw": {"language": "json"}}
        },
        "description": "Una orden LIMIT queda NEW (pendiente) hasta que algo la ejecute; esta API no simula el mercado, así que una LIMIT nunca pasa a FILLED por sí sola. Reserva fondos pero no los gasta."
      },
      "event": [{
        "listen": "test",
        "script": {
          "type": "text/javascript",
          "exec": [
            "pm.test('HTTP 201 aceptada', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
            "const body = pm.response.json();",
            "pm.test('Queda NEW (pendiente, no ejecutada)', () => pm.expect(body.status).to.eql('NEW'));"
          ]
        }
      }]
    },
    {
      "name": "03 - Portfolio tras LIMIT pendiente (baja disponible, no el total)",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [{"key": "Accept", "value": "application/json"}],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/{{userId}}/portfolio?accountNumber={{accountNumber}}",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["api", "v1", "users", "{{userId}}", "portfolio"],
          "query": [{"key": "accountNumber", "value": "{{accountNumber}}"}]
        }
      },
      "event": [{
        "listen": "test",
        "script": {
          "type": "text/javascript",
          "exec": [
            "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
            "const body = pm.response.json();",
            "const baselineCash = Number(pm.collectionVariables.get('baselineAvailableCash'));",
            "const baselineTotal = Number(pm.collectionVariables.get('baselineTotalValue'));",
            "pm.test('availableCash bajó exactamente 100 (reserva, no gasto)', () => {",
            "  pm.expect(body.availableCash).to.be.closeTo(baselineCash - 100, 0.01);",
            "});",
            "pm.test('totalAccountValue no cambia: nada se ejecutó todavía', () => {",
            "  pm.expect(body.totalAccountValue).to.be.closeTo(baselineTotal, 0.01);",
            "});",
            "pm.collectionVariables.set('afterPendingCash', body.availableCash);"
          ]
        }
      }]
    },
    {
      "name": "04 - MARKET BUY (se ejecuta al instante)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"},
          {"key": "Idempotency-Key", "value": "{{$randomUUID}}"}
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/{{userId}}/orders",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["api", "v1", "users", "{{userId}}", "orders"]
        },
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"instrumentId\": {{instrumentIdMarket}},\n  \"side\": \"BUY\",\n  \"type\": \"MARKET\",\n  \"size\": 1\n}",
          "options": {"raw": {"language": "json"}}
        },
        "description": "Una orden MARKET se ejecuta de inmediato al último cierre válido; a diferencia de la LIMIT pendiente, esta sí gasta efectivo (lo convierte en acciones al mismo precio usado para valuar el portfolio)."
      },
      "event": [{
        "listen": "test",
        "script": {
          "type": "text/javascript",
          "exec": [
            "pm.test('HTTP 201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
            "const body = pm.response.json();",
            "pm.test('Queda FILLED de inmediato', () => pm.expect(body.status).to.eql('FILLED'));",
            "pm.collectionVariables.set('marketBuyPrice', body.price);"
          ]
        }
      }]
    },
    {
      "name": "05 - Portfolio tras MARKET BUY (disponible baja según precio ejecutado, total no cambia)",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [{"key": "Accept", "value": "application/json"}],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/{{userId}}/portfolio?accountNumber={{accountNumber}}",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["api", "v1", "users", "{{userId}}", "portfolio"],
          "query": [{"key": "accountNumber", "value": "{{accountNumber}}"}]
        }
      },
      "event": [{
        "listen": "test",
        "script": {
          "type": "text/javascript",
          "exec": [
            "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
            "const body = pm.response.json();",
            "const afterPending = Number(pm.collectionVariables.get('afterPendingCash'));",
            "const executedPrice = Number(pm.collectionVariables.get('marketBuyPrice'));",
            "const baselineQty = Number(pm.collectionVariables.get('baselineQtyMarket'));",
            "const baselineTotal = Number(pm.collectionVariables.get('baselineTotalValue'));",
            "const instrument = body.instruments.find((i) => i.instrumentId === Number(pm.collectionVariables.get('instrumentIdMarket')));",
            "pm.test('La cantidad del instrumento sube en 1', () => pm.expect(instrument.quantity).to.eql(baselineQty + 1));",
            "pm.test('availableCash baja exactamente el precio ejecutado', () => {",
            "  pm.expect(body.availableCash).to.be.closeTo(afterPending - executedPrice, 0.01);",
            "});",
            "pm.test('totalAccountValue no cambia: el efectivo se convirtió en acciones al mismo precio', () => {",
            "  pm.expect(body.totalAccountValue).to.be.closeTo(baselineTotal, 0.01);",
            "});",
            "pm.collectionVariables.set('afterMarketBuyCash', body.availableCash);"
          ]
        }
      }]
    },
    {
      "name": "06 - LIMIT BUY con precio absurdo (esperado 422 INSUFFICIENT_CASH)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"},
          {"key": "Idempotency-Key", "value": "{{$randomUUID}}"}
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/{{userId}}/orders",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["api", "v1", "users", "{{userId}}", "orders"]
        },
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"instrumentId\": {{instrumentIdLimit}},\n  \"side\": \"BUY\",\n  \"type\": \"LIMIT\",\n  \"size\": 1,\n  \"price\": 99999999.99\n}",
          "options": {"raw": {"language": "json"}}
        }
      },
      "event": [{
        "listen": "test",
        "script": {
          "type": "text/javascript",
          "exec": [
            "pm.test('HTTP 422', () => pm.response.to.have.status(422));",
            "const body = pm.response.json();",
            "pm.test('Motivo INSUFFICIENT_CASH', () => pm.expect(body.reason).to.eql('INSUFFICIENT_CASH'));",
            "pm.test('La orden persiste como REJECTED', () => pm.expect(body.order.status).to.eql('REJECTED'));"
          ]
        }
      }]
    },
    {
      "name": "07 - Portfolio tras rechazo por fondos (no debe cambiar nada)",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [{"key": "Accept", "value": "application/json"}],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/{{userId}}/portfolio?accountNumber={{accountNumber}}",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["api", "v1", "users", "{{userId}}", "portfolio"],
          "query": [{"key": "accountNumber", "value": "{{accountNumber}}"}]
        }
      },
      "event": [{
        "listen": "test",
        "script": {
          "type": "text/javascript",
          "exec": [
            "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
            "const body = pm.response.json();",
            "const afterMarketBuy = Number(pm.collectionVariables.get('afterMarketBuyCash'));",
            "pm.test('availableCash sin cambios tras el rechazo', () => {",
            "  pm.expect(body.availableCash).to.be.closeTo(afterMarketBuy, 0.01);",
            "});"
          ]
        }
      }]
    },
    {
      "name": "08 - MARKET SELL sin acciones disponibles (esperado 422 INSUFFICIENT_SHARES)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"},
          {"key": "Idempotency-Key", "value": "{{$randomUUID}}"}
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/{{userId}}/orders",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["api", "v1", "users", "{{userId}}", "orders"]
        },
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"instrumentId\": {{instrumentIdShort}},\n  \"side\": \"SELL\",\n  \"type\": \"MARKET\",\n  \"size\": 1\n}",
          "options": {"raw": {"language": "json"}}
        },
        "description": "instrumentIdShort ya tiene una posición neta negativa (vendida en descubierto) en la cuenta de referencia, con availableQuantity 0; cualquier venta adicional debe rechazarse."
      },
      "event": [{
        "listen": "test",
        "script": {
          "type": "text/javascript",
          "exec": [
            "pm.test('HTTP 422', () => pm.response.to.have.status(422));",
            "const body = pm.response.json();",
            "pm.test('Motivo INSUFFICIENT_SHARES', () => pm.expect(body.reason).to.eql('INSUFFICIENT_SHARES'));"
          ]
        }
      }]
    },
    {
      "name": "09 - Portfolio tras rechazo por acciones (no debe cambiar nada)",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [{"key": "Accept", "value": "application/json"}],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/{{userId}}/portfolio?accountNumber={{accountNumber}}",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["api", "v1", "users", "{{userId}}", "portfolio"],
          "query": [{"key": "accountNumber", "value": "{{accountNumber}}"}]
        }
      },
      "event": [{
        "listen": "test",
        "script": {
          "type": "text/javascript",
          "exec": [
            "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
            "const body = pm.response.json();",
            "const afterMarketBuy = Number(pm.collectionVariables.get('afterMarketBuyCash'));",
            "pm.test('availableCash sin cambios tras el rechazo', () => {",
            "  pm.expect(body.availableCash).to.be.closeTo(afterMarketBuy, 0.01);",
            "});"
          ]
        }
      }]
    },
    {
      "name": "10 - MARKET SELL dentro de lo disponible",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"},
          {"key": "Idempotency-Key", "value": "{{$randomUUID}}"}
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/{{userId}}/orders",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["api", "v1", "users", "{{userId}}", "orders"]
        },
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"instrumentId\": {{instrumentIdMarket}},\n  \"side\": \"SELL\",\n  \"type\": \"MARKET\",\n  \"size\": 2\n}",
          "options": {"raw": {"language": "json"}}
        }
      },
      "event": [{
        "listen": "test",
        "script": {
          "type": "text/javascript",
          "exec": [
            "pm.test('HTTP 201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
            "const body = pm.response.json();",
            "pm.test('Queda FILLED de inmediato', () => pm.expect(body.status).to.eql('FILLED'));",
            "pm.collectionVariables.set('marketSellPrice', body.price);"
          ]
        }
      }]
    },
    {
      "name": "11 - Portfolio final (la venta se refleja; el total se mantuvo todo el recorrido)",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [{"key": "Accept", "value": "application/json"}],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/{{userId}}/portfolio?accountNumber={{accountNumber}}",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["api", "v1", "users", "{{userId}}", "portfolio"],
          "query": [{"key": "accountNumber", "value": "{{accountNumber}}"}]
        }
      },
      "event": [{
        "listen": "test",
        "script": {
          "type": "text/javascript",
          "exec": [
            "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
            "const body = pm.response.json();",
            "const afterMarketBuy = Number(pm.collectionVariables.get('afterMarketBuyCash'));",
            "const sellPrice = Number(pm.collectionVariables.get('marketSellPrice'));",
            "const baselineQty = Number(pm.collectionVariables.get('baselineQtyMarket'));",
            "const baselineTotal = Number(pm.collectionVariables.get('baselineTotalValue'));",
            "const instrument = body.instruments.find((i) => i.instrumentId === Number(pm.collectionVariables.get('instrumentIdMarket')));",
            "pm.test('La cantidad neta terminó en baseline + 1 compra - 2 venta', () => {",
            "  pm.expect(instrument.quantity).to.eql(baselineQty - 1);",
            "});",
            "pm.test('availableCash sumó el producto de la venta', () => {",
            "  pm.expect(body.availableCash).to.be.closeTo(afterMarketBuy + sellPrice * 2, 0.01);",
            "});",
            "pm.test('totalAccountValue se mantuvo igual durante todo el recorrido', () => {",
            "  pm.expect(body.totalAccountValue).to.be.closeTo(baselineTotal, 0.01);",
            "});"
          ]
        }
      }]
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    {"key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8080"},
